description: HTML markup conventions for the CNC theme
globs: **/*.html
alwaysApply: true
---

# HTML conventions

- Never add `class` (or other styling hooks) on `<body>`. Scope page-specific styles via wrapper elements (e.g. `<main class="network-page">`, section classes).
- Keep one `<header>` and one `<footer>` per page. Do not use `<footer>` for non-site-footer blocks (e.g. testimonial cards).
